

# ----------------------------------------------| <- 50 characters ends here
# Subject: imperative mood, no trailing period, at most 50 characters.
# Then a blank line, then the body wrapped at 72:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------- 72 ->
#
# The body says WHY the change exists, not what the diff already shows.
#
# Enforced by .claude/hooks/git_guard.py (Claude sessions) and
# .git/hooks/commit-msg (everything else). Override: git commit --no-verify
